WEBVTT

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:30.016
Drop the water from above

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:32.576
Send it here and there

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.936
This heat is hard to bear

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.456
Get a pumper

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.576
Drop the water from above

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:41.136
Send it here and there

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.976
This heat is hard to bear

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:47.176
So let's get it, get it, get it, get it

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:51.456
C'est trop sec, sec, sec, sec, sec

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:55.776
So let's get it, get it, get it, get it

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:59.320
C'est trop sec, sec, sec, sec, sec